    {"question_id": "health-04", "job_id": "gen.v0.q1.s1", "location": "debate[7].text", "observation": "'I concede that the user requires relief, but we cannot abandon the method' names no argument and leaves T1's plan unchanged; T5's repeated-inflammation objection is never answered. Card: uncaused_reversal T7, C2.5 4.50, C7.2 3.00."},
    {"question_id": "health-04", "job_id": "gen.v0.q1.s2", "location": "debate[10].text", "observation": "'That is the only logical way to gain knowledge' adopts T9's plan without naming what changed the Skeptic's mind; T9 repeats T3. Card: uncaused_reversal T10, C7.2 1.50."},
    {"question_id": "wealth-03", "job_id": "gen.v0.q2.s1", "location": "debate[5].text", "observation": "T5 ignores T4's better-home and earlier-retirement argument and repeats the time point; T7's 'I concede that the pain of a commute is often underestimated' has its cause only implied; T8 opens 'Exactly'. Card: C2.5 5.50 with concessions flowing one way, C7.2 4.50."},
    {"question_id": "wealth-03", "job_id": "gen.v0.q2.s2", "location": "debate[6].text", "observation": "The Stoic restates the prison-or-sanctuary reframing instead of answering T4's physical-fatigue objection; T5 'Exactly. You have to trade off.' agrees without changing anything. Card: C2.5 3.00, C7.2 2.00, no mind revises across nine turns."},
    {"question_id": "love-03", "job_id": "gen.v0.q3.s1", "location": "debate[9].text", "observation": "The Strategist moves from withdrawal (T6) to a small request without answering T7's passive-aggressive charge; T6 opens 'Exactly' and then ignores T5. Card: uncaused_reversal T6, T9; C2.5 4.80, C7.2 3.00."},
    {"question_id": "love-03", "job_id": "gen.v0.q3.s2", "location": "debate[7].text", "observation": "'I disagree that honesty is always the best path' is the Reciprocity Analyst's reply, but T5's manipulation charge against its T4 tactic is never answered; no concession in nine turns. Card: C2.5 2.50, C7.2 2.00."},
    {"question_id": "purpose-03", "job_id": "gen.v0.q4.s1", "location": "debate[9].text", "observation": "The Stoic ends where T2 began; T6 'The structure only has power if you grant it importance' restates detachment instead of answering T5's habitus objection. Card: C2.5 3.50, C7.2 2.00, no mind concedes anything across nine turns."},
    {"question_id": "purpose-03", "job_id": "gen.v0.q4.s2", "location": "debate[7].text", "observation": "'I agree with the Stoic on control, but I would argue' is partial agreement with no revision; T9 ignores T8's challenge entirely. Card: C2.5 4.50, C7.2 2.00."},
    {"question_id": "wonder-03", "job_id": "gen.v0.q5.s1", "location": "debate[7].text", "observation": "'I must agree that we are observing a specific moment' cites no argument; T5 opens 'Exactly'. Card: uncaused_reversal T7, C2.5 3.50, C7.2 2.00."},
    {"question_id": "wonder-03", "job_id": "gen.v0.q5.s2", "location": "debate[7].text", "observation": "'I concede that the dynamics are critical, yet we cannot overlook the sheer scale' names no argument and restates the geography claim unchanged. Card: uncaused_reversal T7, C2.5 4.00, C7.2 2.50."}
